x86-64 Machine-Dependent Code
==============================

This directory is designated for x86-64 (AMD64) architecture-specific
machine-dependent code.

Full implementation would require:
- Low-level startup code (start.s, locore.s)
- Page mapping and memory management (pmap.c)
- Trap and interrupt handling (trap.c, intr.c)
- Context switching (cswtch.s, pcb.c)
- System call interface
- FPU/SSE support
- APIC/interrupt controller support
- And other x86-64 specific implementations

This is currently a placeholder directory for build system integration.
